# Terraform working files. The state file ends up containing the composed
# DATABASE_URLs and the generated secrets, and terraform.tfvars carries real
# credentials (Google/AI API keys) — local only, never committed.
.terraform*/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
crash.log
terraform.tfvars
# The lock file (.terraform.lock.hcl) IS committed — it pins provider versions
# so every machine validates/plans against the same provider builds.
